sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant A as API
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    U->>F: Open the portal after signing in
    F->>A: GET onboarding
    A->>D: Find a membership for this user
    alt membership found
        A-->>F: Organization, workspace and role
    else none
        A-->>F: 404 onboarding required
        F-->>U: Ask for organization and workspace names
        U->>F: Submit names
        F->>A: POST onboarding
        A->>D: Begin transaction
        A->>D: Create organization
        A->>D: Create workspace
        A->>D: Create owner membership
        A->>D: Commit
        A-->>F: 201 with the new workspace
    end
    F->>F: Remember the workspace ID for later requests
